# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & environment
# Nothing that resolves to a real credential may ever be tracked.
# `.env.example` is the only env file that is committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
service-account*.json
gcp-credentials*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
credentials.json
token.json
.secrets/

